			{
				"id": "about:about:en",
				"slug": "about",
				"status": "published",
				"data": {
					"label": "About me",
					"subtitle": "Who is Javier Aday Pérez Romero?",
					"paragraphs": [
						"An technology enthusiast, with experience in software development. Currently a Computer Science student at the University of Las Palmas de Gran Canaria.",
						"Since I was little I have liked to tinker with technology. I started by creating calculators in C# and Java, and little by little I got into the world of software development.",
						"Thanks to technology, I have been able to meet many interesting people and participate in various projects, both personal and professional."
					]
				},
				"locale": "en"
			},
			{
				"id": "about:about:es",
				"slug": "about",
				"status": "published",
				"data": {
					"label": "Sobre mí",
					"subtitle": "¿Quién es Javier Aday Pérez Romero?",
					"paragraphs": [
						"Un apasionado de la tecnología, con experiencia en el desarrollo de software. Actualmente estudiante de Ingeniería Informática en la Universidad de Las Palmas de Gran Canaria.",
						"Desde pequeño me ha gustado trastear con la tecnología. Empecé creando calculadoras en C# y Java, y poco a poco me fui adentrando en el mundo del desarrollo de software.",
						"Gracias a la tecnología he podido conocer a mucha gente interesante y he podido participar en varios proyectos, tanto personales como profesionales."
					]
				},
				"locale": "es",
				"translationOf": "about:about:en"
			}
		],
